2.10 Thereupon, present appeal is preferred by the appellant on the following grounds:
a) That the respondent no. 2 does not have any authority to pass the impugned order dated 28.11.2023;
b) That the impugned order was passed ignoring the order dated 11.01.2024 passed by the Additional Commissioner of Transport Delhi Police;
c) That there was no ground to cancel or renew the license as per Section 29 (3) of the Act;
RCA DJ No. 01/2026 Satbir Rana Vs. NHAI Page No. 5 of 23 Satbir Rana vs Nhai on 3 February, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/38757165/
3 d) That the impugned order is passed arbitrarily without application of mind and without following the rules of natural justice;
e) That the impugned order was passed in retaliation to the legal right asserted by the appellant with respective land being encroached by respondent no. 1.
